=== Disable bbPress Profile Override ===
Contributors: travis.hill 
Donate link:http://domainsoil.com/donate/
Tags: bbpress, buddypress, profile
Requires at least: 3.x
Tested up to: 3.x
Stable tag: 0.1

bbPress profile URLs are overridden by BuddyPress. This plugin removes that override so bbPress member profiles are available.

== Description ==

Links to bbPress profiles are overridden (filtered) and pointed to a members BuddyPress profile when using the bbPress plugin with BuddyPress. **Disable bbPress Profile Override** removes the BuddyPress URL override, making bbPress member profile links available.

[Disable bbPress Profile Override Plugin Page](http://domainsoil.com/products/disable-bbpress-profile-override/)

[Disable bbPress Profile Override Support](http://support.domainsoil.com/disable-bbpress-profile-override/)

[Disable bbPress Profile Override Trac](http://trac.domainsoil.com/disable-bbpress-profile-override/)

[Demo](http://labs.domainsoil.com/bbpress/forums/)

*Notice the link to the profile points to `/forums/users/` and the "Blog Authors" link (in the buddybar) points to `/buddypress/members/`*

== Installation ==

= Minimum Requirements =

* WordPress 3.x
* BuddyPress 1.5
* bbPress 2.0
* PHP version 5.2.4 or greater
* MySQL version 5.0 or greater

= From the Dashboard =

1. Login to your WordPress&reg; Powered site.
2. Navigate to Plugins > Add New.
3. In the search box, type in **Disable bbPress Profile Override.**
4. Locate the plugin within the search results, and install.

= From the File =

1. Download the plugin zip file onto your computer.
2. Extract the zip file into a directory.
3. FTP the `/disable-bbp-profile-override` directory into the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory of your WordPress&reg; installation.
4. Activate the plugin from the Plugins Dashboard.

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= Is there a Options Page? =

*Nope, no need for one! Just activate and go!*

= Are any options written into my database? =

*Nope! No clutter here.*

